      "confidence": "high",
      "status": "drafted",
      "note": "MIGRATED FROM `window_head_masonry` 24 Aug 2026 (OQ 46), when the `arch` slot was added. A rule ABOUT arches which states that there are none -- 'All openings shall be spanned by lintels. No arches.' It had nowhere to live: a prohibition on arches is not a statement about a window head. The old slot is left `open`/`empty` on this kit rather than carrying a pointer, because the same fact in two places is what this migration exists to prevent."
    },
